<h2>Concept</h2>

<div class="side-by-side">
  <p class="big">
    A set of bold 3D visuals centers on a fantasy-inspired glowing pond, which
    represents creativity and growth.
  </p>
  <p>
    The branding comes from the studio's organic origins and revolves around a
    glowing pond. In Blender, I built a colorful 3D environment with dancing fireflies, animated ripples, and swaying foliage. For the website, I placed
    designs by Mateo Julia-Wise into this environment to show the studio's
    graphic work.
  </p>
</div>

